","1. **Translate the function:**  
   The function $f(x)$ is translated right by $\frac{\pi}{12}$ units, so the new function is:  
   \[
   f(x - \frac{\pi}{10}) = \sin \left( \omega (x - \frac{\pi}{10}) + \varphi \right)
   \]  
