   - \( L_v = 1858.5 \, \text{kJ/kg} \)
   - \( T_{\text{vaporization}} = 220 + 273.15 = 493.15 \, \text{K} \)
   - \( m_{\text{water}} = 1 \, \text{kg} \)

   Substituting the values:
   \[
   \Delta S_{\text{water}} = 1 \times \frac{1858.5}{493.15} = 3.70 \, \text{kJ/K}
   \]

3. **Total entropy change**:
   \[
