   The mass flow rate \( \dot{m} \) is given by \( \dot{m} = \rho A_1 u_1 = \rho A_2 u_2 \), where \( \rho \) is the density of air, \( u_1 \) is the inlet velocity, and \( u_2 \) is the exit velocity.  
